The entitlement rule applies to both (`request.amount <= facts.entitlement`), and the one-reissue rule applies to reissues. For a refund, "period" isn't meaningful. The simplest cohesive approach: give the payment family a capture that handles both actions — for reissue it reads period entitlement and prior reissues; for refund it reads an appropriate entitlement/premises. 

